        "step2": "View all your bets organized by match",
        "step3": "Filter by status: Pending, Won, Lost, or All",
        "step4": "See your profit/loss for each individual bet",
        "step5": "Also accessible from Match Center → \"My Bets\" tab"
      },
      "leaderboard": {
        "title": "Leaderboard",
        "description": "Check the group rankings — see who's leading in profit, win rate, and total bets.",
